.*       THE PURPOSE OF THIS MACRO IS TO LOAD DEVICE SUPPORTED   XM4256 06720003
.*       ROCHESTER OWNED MODULES FROM THE DISTRIBUTION LIBRARY   XM4256 06780003
.*       ' SYS1.AOSU0 ' TO THE SYSTEM LIBRARY ' SYS1.LINKLIB '   XM4256 06840003
